      "id": "claim_9f176a3a9b9944fea14e59bfbde9c649",
      "statement": "FlexAnnotate's dependency rule holds: features import core, shared and utils, and src/hooks.ts is the only module that knows all features — it imports every feature module and holds the single ordered Feature array that startAll/stopAll/addToWindow/removeFromWindow run over.",
