      "id": "claim_9824e631ff5745a39cda87e7ed71b48a",
      "statement": "src/hooks.ts registers three citation-dialog injectors at module load — modeSelector first, then the organizer's outlineView, followed by annotationRowPatch — and registration order fixes injection order.",
