    {
      "id": "claim_dc35d7538d174d86ad3c669e53a185bf",
      "statement": "src/index.ts performs the global setup as a module side effect at bundle load, guarded by Zotero[config.addonInstance] so re-execution is a no-op: it creates the Addon (whose data carries alive, config, env, initialized and the first ztoolkit, hooks holds the hooks module, api starts empty), defines the global ztoolkit as a getter, and assigns the instance to Zotero[config.addonInstance], i.e. Zotero.FlexAnnotate.",
