    {
      "id": "claim_fce789401d8445779071fc2ce0de1415",
      "statement": "The global ztoolkit is a live getter returning _globalThis.addon.data.ztoolkit, and hooks.ts recreates addon.data.ztoolkit on every main-window load, so the global always refers to the current window's toolkit and ztoolkit.unregisterAll() in onMainWindowUnload removes exactly that window's UI; modules using it cannot be imported outside the plugin sandbox.",
